1
00:00:00,788 --> 00:00:02,878
...two of which are fairly close to me.

2
00:00:03,625 --> 00:00:06,465
(Raj:)Her spontaneity is contagious.

3
00:00:07,962 --> 00:00:10,462
(Bernadette:)Who's Siri?
Is he dating somebody new?

4
00:00:11,007 --> 00:00:13,297
(Howard:)Yes. His phone.

5
00:00:16,137 --> 00:00:18,137
(Bernadette:)Is that cute or creepy?

6
00:00:19,432 --> 00:00:20,512
(Howard:)Uh-huh.

7
00:00:22,518 --> 00:00:24,858
(Raj:)Can I pour you some wine?
I think you'll enjoy it.

8
00:00:25,021 --> 00:00:28,021
(Raj:)Traditional choice with Peking duck
is a sauvignon blanc...

9
00:00:28,191 --> 00:00:30,861
(Raj:)...but Siri suggested an off-dry Riesling.

10
00:00:31,027 --> 00:00:32,157
(Raj:)I wasn't sure...

11
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:36,200
...but I didn't wanna have an argument
with her in the middle of Trader Joe's.

12
00:00:39,494 --> 00:00:43,874
(Raj:)Now, what should we put Siri in
for dinner?

13
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,540
Leopard, sparkles?

14
00:00:46,709 --> 00:00:50,299
Or to paraphrase Coco Chanel:

15
00:00:50,463 --> 00:00:54,383
"You can never go wrong
with a little black case."

16
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:59,810
(Raj:)Siri, play some smooth jazz.

17
00:00:59,973 --> 00:01:04,023
(Siri:)Playing smooth jazz.

